<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/msa@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1A) The expenses referred to in paragraph (1)(v) are subject to the following: (a) the claim is evidenced by a receipt issued in respect of the payment or purchase, as the case may be; (b) the deduction under subparagraph (1)(v)(ii) shall be claimed once either in the year of assessment 2025, 2026 or 2027; (c) the deduction under subparagraphs (1)(v)(iii) and (iv) shall be claimed once either in the year of assessment 2026 or 2027; and (d) the total amount of deduction under this paragraph is subject to a maximum amount of two thousand five hundred ringgit.”; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/msa@> .
